   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "geometry_radiation_step1410",
     "description": "Radiation driven by the column geometry and the solar geometry, daytime clear sky, step 1410 (radiation call 2820): WRFColumnGeometry supplies p, exner, z above ground, p8w, T, t8w and dz8w to Dudhia SW, the RRTM column mapping and the RRTM LW heating through their coupling-target parameters, and WRFSolarGeometry supplies Dudhia's csza and solcon, in place of the dumped profiles those components' standalone tests use. Humidity, cloud and the RRTM fluxes still come from the dumped libraries. References: WRF 4.8 em_scm_xy real32 build, merged suite dump esm_dump_scm_suite_1410.json and kernel dumps of the same step; the geometry state is dyn_column of fork 83347b2, the solar kernel fork 1b4b556. Tolerances bound the real32 equation-of-state rounding in p (N67) and the solar-time rounding in coszen (N69). Assertions: sol_coszen: Solar geometry reproduces the csza the WRF radiation driver passed to Dudhia SW (abs 2e-6, N69). sol_solcon: Solar geometry reproduces WRF's distance-corrected solar constant. sw_gsw: Downward surface shortwave flux against the WRF suite dump. sw_dthdt: Shortwave heating profile against the WRF suite dump. sw_p: Geometry layer pressure against the p3d Dudhia SW was dumped with (real32 equation-of-state rounding, N67). sw_exner: Geometry Exner function against the dumped pi3d. sw_ze: Geometry heights above ground against the dumped real32 cumulative sum of dz8w (abs 5e-3 m, ~4e-7 relative at the model top). col_p: Geometry layer pressure against the dumped RRTM p3d. col_p_e: Geometry hydrostatic interface pressure p_hyd_w against the dumped RRTM interface pressure (p_top at the top, psfc at the ground, not the extrapolated p8w). col_T: Geometry temperature against the dumped RRTM t3d. col_T_e: Geometry interface temperature against the dumped RRTM t8w. col_dz_m: Geometry layer thickness against the dumped RRTM dz8w. heat_p_e: Geometry hydrostatic interface pressure p_hyd_w against the interface pressure the RRTM LW heating was dumped with. heat_exner: Geometry Exner function against the pi3d the RRTM LW heating was dumped with.",
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "mu_p0": -97.75,
      "mu_b0": 79363.078125,
      "p_top0": 17761.310546875,
      "xtime0": 1409.0,
      "radt0": 0.0,
      "gmt0": 19.0,
      "julian0": 295.7701416015625,
      "xlat0": 37.599998474121094,
      "xlong0": -96.69999694824219,
      "albedo0": 0.20000000298023224,
      "obscur0": 0.0,
      "cssca0": 9.999999747378752e-06,
      "icloud0": 1.0
     },
     "time_span": {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1
     },
     "assertions": [
      {
       "variable": "sol_coszen",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 0.6393358707427979,
       "tolerance": {
        "abs": 2e-06
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "sol_solcon",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 1385.0826416015625,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-05
       }
      },
      {
